==Russian==

===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*sila}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-bsl-pro|*séiˀlāˀ}}. Cognates include {{cog|lt|síela}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ru-IPA|си́ла}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-сила.ogg}}

====Noun====
{{ru-noun+|си́ла|adj=силово́й|aug=си́лища|hypocor=си́лушка|pej=силёнка,сили́шка}}

# [[strength]]
#: {{coi|ru|[[в силу|в '''си́лу''']]|[[because of]]}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[из|и́зо]] [[весь|всех]] '''сил'''|with all one's might}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[не]] [[в]] '''си́лах'''|[[unable]]}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[не]] [[по]] '''си́лам'''|beyond one’s '''strength'''}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[свой|свои́ми]] '''си́лами'''|[[by oneself]]}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''сил''' [[нет]]|[[awfully]]; to be [[dying]] for; to be [[crazy]] about}}
# [[force]]
# [[power]], [[might]]
#: {{coi|ru|[[лошади́ная си́ла]]|[[horsepower|horse'''power''']]}}
# [[vigor]]
# [[intensity]]
# [[efficacy]]
# [[energy]]
# [[volume]]

